CM simple Yagi-Uda
CM
CM simple 2 element Yagi-Uda beam antenna over average ground
CE
SY height=40ft
SY length=5.18
SY separation=2.0
SY reflector=1.04
! driven element
GW 1,21,0,-length,height,0,length,height,1in
! reflector, placed behind (negative x axis) the driven element
GW 2,21,-separation,-length*reflector,height,-separation,length*reflector,height,1in
! use average ground
GE 0
EX 0,1,11,0,1,0
GN 0,0,0,0,13,0.005
FR 0,1,0,0,14,0
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
EN
